== titlestate.py prepare/release: a held session boots the composed disk
ok   a held returning session of a title with no golden is refused
ok     ... before any push and before hddPath moved
ok   prepare points hddPath at titles.qcow2
ok     ... with Tron's golden loaded, recorded
ok     ... the disk is mode 660, not the 0644 a push leaves
ok     ... and the marker holds hdd.img, the dispatcher's own
ok     ... the golden verifies on the device's disk
ok   release harvests what the session wrote, to latest
ok     ... leaves the golden alone
ok     ... and puts hddPath back on hdd.img, marker gone
ok   a disk that cannot be made 660 fails the prepare
